{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>You certainly</b> — a lie, as in: \"Your lies, the dead will be silenced\" and \"in the month that he fabricated from his heart.\" And in the language of our Sages, of blessed memory: בדאי [fabricator]."], :book :nehemiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {0 "בודאם read as 'you fabricate them'; Ibn Ezra glosses it as the root בדא/בדה, to fabricate falsehood."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nehemiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nechemya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:15:09.958469090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}